OL,3,GNEWSAA 'tsunami river' destroyed my    
OL,4,Akids' childhood in one day             
OL,6,FFamilies whose homes were submerged by 
OL,7,Fa torrent of mine water after a quarry 
OL,8,Fblast fear their children could be     
OL,9,Fcaught in another flood as experts warn
OL,10,Fother UK communities may be at risk.   
OL,12,FFifteen homes in the of village of     
OL,13,FGwaelod-y-Garth, north of Cardiff were 
OL,14,Faffected - and 13 evacuated - when a   
OL,15,F"tsunami river" from old iron mine     
OL,16,Fworkings hit after a planned quarry    
OL,17,Fexplosion in south Wales.              
OL,19,FNow experts have told a BBC            
OL,20,Finvestigation more needs to be done to 
OL,21,Fprotect people and prevent them living 
OL,22,Fin unsellable homes.                   
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
